From ded79805bc1d7948e04d20962199012f98379d1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@localhost>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:08:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign catalog UI and add five selectable themes

- Unify search and filters into one collapsible toolbar panel with an
  active-filters counter
- Invert card icon block colors (deep green in dark themes, pastel in
  light ones) and add AI model badges on cards
- Add light/dark/auto plus transition themes dawn, overcast and dusk
  with scattered app icon background decor
- Tone down overcast and dawn palettes, clean up dark-theme icon block
  gradient
- Drop the center digit from the NumConverter icon
---
